  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large Dutch oven over medium-high heat.",
    "Sear lamb cubes until browned, about 5 minutes. Remove from pot and set aside.",
    "Add onion and carrots to pot and cook until tender, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add potatoes, thyme, salt, and pepper to pot. Cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Add browned lamb, red wine, stout, and broth to pot. Stir to combine.",
    "Bring stew to a boil, then cover and transfer to oven.",
